      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, OATH has the capacity and ability to adjudicate a wide variety of administrative matters, including matters currently or previously adjudicated by independent Impartial Hearing Officers pursuant to 20 U.S.C. \u00a7 1415, Education Law \u00a7 4404, Section 504 of the Rehabilitation Act of 1973, as amended, codified at 29 U.S.C. \u00a7 794, and its implementing regulations, 34 C.F.R. Part 104, and the Regulations of the Commissioner of SED; and",
