      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, OATH, DOE, and SED have entered a Memorandum of Agreement, dated December 1, 2021 (the MOA), in which they agreed that the transfer of the handling of the impartial hearing system to OATH is appropriate and will facilitate the effective management of current and future filings, and the MOA was ratified by DOE's Chancellor;",
